    "title": "Nuts & Woods: Screw Puzzle",
    "description": "In Nuts and Woods, your goal is to untangle and solve intricate wooden puzzles by strategically maneuvering bolts and nuts. Each level offers a new and exciting challenge, requiring you to think critically and plan your moves carefully. As you progress, the puzzles become more complex, providing a continuous sense of accomplishment and fun.\r\nWhy should you give Nuts and Woods a shot? The game offers straightforward yet deeply satisfying gameplay that appeals to both casual gamers and puzzle enthusiasts. Its intuitive mechanics and progressively challenging levels ensure that you\u2019re constantly engaged and entertained. Whether you have a few minutes or a few hours to spare, Nuts and Woods is the perfect way to relax and stimulate your mind.\r\nEmbark on a delightful puzzle-solving adventure with Nuts and Woods. Test your skills, conquer challenging levels, and enjoy endless fun. Download Nuts and Woods today and experience the joy of addictive puzzle gameplay!",
